WEBVTT

00:04:56.872 --> 00:05:00.245
Lakini kuna mwanya kati
ya mahali hilo linasimama,

00:05:00.269 --> 00:05:02.860
na jinsi ninavyowasilisha
hayo kwa ulimwengu unaonizunguka.

00:05:03.416 --> 00:05:06.892
Na hii inaweza kufanya
mawasiliano ya kawaida kuwa na changamoto.

00:05:08.106 --> 00:05:11.365
Sio sehemu nyingi zinaweza kuniajiri,
kwa sababu ya ukosefu wa stadi za kijamii,

00:05:11.389 --> 00:05:13.689
Ndio maana niliomba kazi Waffle House.

00:05:13.713 --> 00:05:19.300
(Kicheko)

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:23.748
Waffle House ni mgahawa wa
masaa 24 ---

00:05:23.772 --> 00:05:25.725
(Kicheko)

00:05:25.749 --> 00:05:29.003
(Makofi)

00:05:29.027 --> 00:05:30.967
Asante --